Code
- mods/retropet-spaces, retropet-agents, retropet-chrome, retropet-pane,
  retropet-status, retropet-tabs, retropet-files and retropet-changes are
  modified copies of mods shipped with the Herdr app (spaces, agents,
  workspace-chrome, pane, workspace-status, tabs, files, changes;
  https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app, Apache License 2.0).
- retropet-spaces, retropet-agents (its list, headings and sort),
  retropet-chrome, retropet-pane, retropet-status, the square tabs and the
  card scene's sky and floor (mods/retropet-agents/scene.svg) come from
  herdr-pixel-layout by murtuzaalisurti
  (https://github.com/murtuzaalisurti/herdr-pixel-layout, Apache License 2.0).
- The Digimon card (machine colors, status badge, pixel type) and the theme
  (themes/retropet.json) come from herdr-retro by Marlon Azevedo
  (https://github.com/MarlonAzevedo/herdr-retro, Apache License 2.0).

Sprites
- mods/retropet-agents/digimon.js holds pixel sprites taken from the dmall,
  dmc and dm20 sets of wayland-vpets by Saatvik Sharma and contributors
  (https://github.com/furudbat/wayland-vpets, MIT License). Patamon and
  Gabumon were recolored for this layout.
- Digimon and all related characters and images are owned by Bandai Co.,
